  "nameEn": "Lamplighter Exam",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Make 12 jumps (2 × 6). Before a wall try right, otherwise turn the robot left. Repair a sparking lamp and light it, light a dark one, leave a shining one, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there.",
  "descriptionEn": "The final test of the topic: winding stairs, nested loops, repairs, bulbs, repair kits and lamps that already shine.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Make 12 jumps (2 × 6). Before a wall try right, otherwise turn the robot left. Only repair a sparking lamp, turn off a shining one, leave lamps without bulbs and those already off alone, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there."
